From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AkaraChen <akarachen@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:03:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] acpc: number and multi-select elicitation fields

Elicitation forms with number, integer or multi-select fields used to
fall back to a bare accept/decline prompt. Numbers are typed into the
composer and checked against the schema bounds on submit; multi-select
fields render as a checklist (space or a digit toggles, Enter moves on)
with min/max item checks.
